{
  "spec": "CONTROL.md §14.10 (off)",
  "note": "Triggers are off until the person runs `sessionpipe triggers on` at the machine. Off, every notice is acked `refused` with `triggers_off` and every clock tick is refused the same way (a history line); turning them off drops every run that waits (acked `refused` `triggers_off`), cancels every running triggered turn, and sends every receiver a hello with no topics.",
